FIT (Flexible and Interoperable Data Transfer) is a protocol of Garmin International, Inc.
This repository contains no code from the Garmin FIT SDK. The reader in fit_engine.js was
written from the FIT protocol. The package @garmin/fitsdk is a development dependency used
only as a test oracle; it is installed from npm under Garmin's FIT Protocol License Agreement
and is not redistributed here. BikeLab Studio is not affiliated with or endorsed by Garmin.

Test files in ./corpus are downloaded at test time from their original repositories
(test/corpus.json lists repository, commit, path and SHA-256) and remain under their own
licences. The synthetic files in data/synth were generated by tools/synth.py.

